# Build dependencies for SDDM 0.20.0 (all present on the ISO / build env)
- Extra-CMake-Modules (ECM >= 1.4.0)
- PAM
- xau (pkg-config: xau)
- XCB
- XKB (libxkbcommon) + xkb
- Qt >= 5.15.0 (Qt5 CONFIG: Core, DBus, Gui, Qml, Quick,
  LinguistTools, Test, QuickTest) -> REQUIRES the Qt 5.15.2 migration
- (build tools) cmake >= 3.4, C++ compiler
# Runtime
- weston (Wayland compositor; [Wayland] CompositorCommand, default
  "weston --shell=fullscreen-shell.so")
- Qt Wayland platform plugin (qtwayland: libqwayland-{egl,generic}.so) for the
  greeter's QT_QPA_PLATFORM=wayland
- Elogind (seat/admin + session tracking; USE_ELOGIND=ON)
- sddm system user in video/input groups
